    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MM Ward Estate Agents are delighted to present Apartment 26, Block C, Church Court, Naas to the market.\n\nThis superbly presented two bedroom ground floor apartment offers bright, spacious and well proportioned accommodation in one of Naas` most sought after residential developments.\n\nPresented in excellent turnkey condition, the property is ideally suited to first time buyers, down sizers, investors or anyone seeking a convenient town centre lifestyle.\n\nIdeally positioned just a short stroll from Naas Town Centre, the apartment enjoys immediate access to an excellent range of amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, leisure facilities and Naas General Hospital. \n\nThe M7 motorway and Sallins Train Station are also within easy reach, making this an ideal location for commuters.\n\nChurch Court is a mature and exceptionally well maintained development, featuring attractive communal grounds, designated resident parking and ample visitor parking. The apartment also benefits from its own private patio door access and a south west facing aspect to the front, allowing for an abundance of afternoon and evening sunshine.\n\nExtending to approximately 63 sq.m.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with excellent storage, a bright and spacious open-plan living and dining room, a fully fitted kitchen, two generous double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes and a well-appointed family bathroom\n\nLarge windows throughout flood the apartment with natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. \nAdditional features include double glazed windows, electric heating, an intercom system, excellent storage facilities and an allocated parking space.\n\nCombining comfort, convenience and an unbeatable central location, Apartment 26 represents an exceptional opportunity to acquire a quality home in the heart of Naas.\n\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall - 7'6\" (2.29m) x 9'5\" (2.87m)\nTiled floor, Alarm point, Hot press, Enclosed storage\n\nLiving Room - 12'1\" (3.68m) x 14'1\" (4.29m)\nWood flooring, Part wall tiling, Patio door\n\nKitchen - 19'1\" (5.82m) x 9'5\" (2.87m)\nFully fitted kitchen, Built in fridge freezer, oven, hob & extractor fan\n\nBathroom - 6'8\" (2.03m) x 5'6\" (1.68m)\nTiled floor, Part tiled walls, WC, WHB, Tub with shower mixer taps\n\nBedroom 1 - 8'5\" (2.57m) x 14'1\" (4.29m)\nBuilt in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 2 - 9'11\" (3.02m) x 10'9\" (3.28m)\nBuilt in wardrobe\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Well maintained communal area </li><li> South west facing to the front </li><li> Ground floor 2 bed </li><li> Own patio door </li><li> Parking space and plenty of visitors spaces </li><li> BER: C </li><li> Management fee: 1,400 per annum </li><li> Located in the heart of Naas </li><li> Easy access to the Naas Ring road and further afield</li></ul>"
